OL,3,GNEWSACzech Saturday school fears losing
OL,4,Aclassrooms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head teacher of a Czech Saturday
OL,7,Fschool attended by about 70 children
OL,8,Fhas said she fears she will "struggle"
OL,9,Fto find new premises after councillors
OL,10,Fagreed to close the primary school
OL,11,Fwhere it holds lessons.
OL,13,FCzech School & Community Manchester has
OL,14,Fheld classes at St Teresa's RC Primary
OL,15,FSchool in Firswood, Trafford, for just
OL,16,Fover two years, with children
OL,17,Ftravelling from as far as Sheffield to
OL,18,Fattend.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
