OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACzech Saturday school fears losing
OL,4,Aclassrooms
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrafford Council decided to shut St
OL,7,FTeresa's after it said falling pupil
OL,8,Fnumbers made its finances
OL,9,Funsustainable.
OL,11,FPavla Mataskova, head teacher, said she
OL,12,Fneeded enough space for nine classes
OL,13,Fand had a limited budget. The council
OL,14,Fand diocese said they would help look
OL,15,Ffor "alternatives".
